<titlePage type="series"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#g">Friedrich Schleiermacher's<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">literari&#x017F;cher Nachlaß</hi></hi><hi rendition="#b">.</hi></titlePart><lb/>
